Package: turntrim
Type: Package
Title: Trim a Chat Transcript to a Token Budget
Version: 0.1.0
Description: A command-line tool that reads the turns of a chat transcript from
    standard input and shows which turns fit a token budget, how the tokens are
    shared, how the turns group into chunks and what a transcript costs.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
